<title>USA: Marquette awarded full-line contract.</title>
<headline>Marquette awarded full-line contract.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marquette Medical Systems Inc said Thursday that Premier Inc, an alliance of hospital and healthcare systems, awarded it a three-year patient monitoring equipment purchasing contract.</p>
<p>Combined with earlier contracts, the relationship now covers Marquette's entire product line, including adult and perinatal vital signs monitoring, diagnostic cardiology and clinical information systems.</p>
<p>It said the agreement also includes access to Marquette's financial risk sharing program, Managed Use. The value of the agreement was not disclosed.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
